bi preconfezionati. Quest'ultimo, che ha parecchie cose da nascondere, tenta di farne carne in scatola."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Wing or the Thigh?","overview":"Charles Duchemin, a well-known gourmet and publisher of a famous restaurant guide, is waging a war against fast food entrepreneur Tri- catel to save the French art of cooking. After having agreed to appear on a talk show to show his skills in naming food and wine by taste, he is confronted with two disasters: his son wants to become a clown rather than a restaurant tester and he, the famous Charles Duchemin, has lost his taste!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Charles Duchemin, l'éditeur d'une revue gastronomique de renom, voudrait que son fils, Gérard, lui succède. Mais celui-ci préfère faire le clown dans un cirque. Charles lance un défi à Tricatel, le roi de la cuisine industrielle en le conviant à une émission télé. Mais Charles perd le goût et l'odorat…","tagline":"« Moi, je nourris des millions de personnes. Et demain, je nourrirai peut-être la terre entière ! Simplement, naturellement. »"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOKEqWuA6wAVYD31P1MkJmTVNMC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cHpBJ6EhBj2ZVCvMIsd8RJuoIjU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":761,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOKEqWuA6wAVYD31P1MkJmTVNMC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gOKEqWuA6wAVYD31P1MkJmTVNMC.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOKEqWuA6wAVYD31P1MkJmTVNMC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gOKEqWuA6wAVYD31P1MkJmTVNMC.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w6H2AM9